CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785071911
OL,3,CBurnham says he will stand up to Trump
OL,4,C'if right for Britain'
OL,6,FBurnham said he was "very aware" of
OL,7,FChancellor John Healey's position and
OL,8,Fresignation as Sir Keir's defence
OL,9,Fsecretary following disagreements over
OL,10,Fthe issue.
OL,12,FHe said: "The first challenge facing
OL,13,Fus both is to ensure that the defence
OL,14,Finvestment plan is fully funded and
OL,15,Fthat's the thing that's right in front
OL,16,Fof us and we need to work that through
OL,17,Fas we go towards the budget later this
OL,18,Fyear."
OL,26,@nD@UOUnD@`O]tD@JOUzD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
