CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785071911
OL,3,CBurnham says he will stand up to Trump
OL,4,C'if right for Britain'
OL,6,FHealey accused the former Chancellor
OL,7,FRachel Reeves and Sir Keir of putting
OL,8,Fthe country's security at risk with a
OL,9,Fdisagreement over the long-awaited
OL,10,Fdefence investment plan.
OL,12,FElsewhere, new Defence Secretary Wes
OL,13,FStreeting said he shared "very warm
OL,14,Fconversation" with his US counterpart
OL,15,FPete Hegseth.
OL,17,FThey are thought to have brainstormed
OL,18,Fideas for an international conference
OL,19,Fwhich allies of the UK and US would
OL,20,Fattend, but have not yet firmed up the
OL,21,Fdetails of a summit.
OL,26,@uD@ZOUvD@MO]
